description:
  en: 'sidebar assistant plugin: A sidebar assistant plugin for the DSH (DeepSeek Harness) Web interface. In the Web chat interface, users can select any text to ask a question based on the selected content. The model answers by referencing both the conversation history of the current session and the selected text, while streaming its reasoning process and final answer in a floating panel.'
  zh: '侧边栏助手插件:一个面向 DSH（DeepSeek Harness）Web 界面的侧边栏助手插件。在 Web 聊天界面里选中任意文本，即可根据所选内容发起提问，模型会参考当前会话的对话历史与选中的引用文字作答，并在浮层面板里流式显示思考过程与最终答案。'